# NAME: cTrader 数据
# TYPE: data
# REPO: https://github.com/kevshen13/surge-rules
# UPDATED: 2026-11-13
# ROUTING: Choose an independent policy for each list; app and feed exits need not match.
# ORDER: Place data-source DOMAIN/IP rules before program PROCESS-NAME rules.
# GATEWAY: PROCESS-NAME identifies only processes on the Surge host, not remote LAN PCs.
# SOURCE: https://help.ctrader.com/open-api/proxies-endpoints/
# NOTE: Covers Open API plus verified desktop proxy endpoints; match before generic China-direct rules.

DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ctraderapi.com

# Desktop proxy namespaces advertised in the observed server certificate.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,p.ctrader.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,p.c-trader.com

# Windows cTrader China accelerator aliases, observed 2026-11-13.
# Both present a p.ctrader.com certificate with *.p.ctrader.com / *.p.c-trader.com SANs.
# Use exact hostnames; never route all Alibaba Cloud accelerator domains as cTrader.
DOMAIN,ga-bp18jk89ublrpdjh4gyzr.aliyunga0017.com
DOMAIN,ga-bp1yijrs7ynsoahqkfska.aliyunga0019.com
